  "body_text": "--- 俺们的铁杆客人龚玉同学的心血\n--- 从小镇的点评，到梅龙镇与小镇店的外卖平台\n--- 龚老师是苦口婆心多次提醒，要记得通知大家\n--- 最后，实在实在憋不住了，连文案也一并提供了\n大写的\n棒\n棒哒\n立秋来了，还有台风暴雨大太阳\n还不马上来一杯有容乃大的外卖？\n什么？你不知道小短手的外卖已经上线了？\n（加两个截屏）\n还不赶快点一杯试试看\n*友情提醒，虽然“小短手”的同学们已经用处女座plus模式测试了各种外卖方案，但外卖实际效果与到店饮用有一定差异，敬请谅解。\n推荐：\n冰美式， 冰拿铁，茶拿铁，巧克力\n突然想到一个推广：\n每月在外卖平台，累计点够10杯的客人，可以喜提以下福利（任选1）\n店内任意咖啡饮品一杯\n混合挂耳包一盒（邮费到付）\n外卖平台的优惠券会陆续更新起来\n记得时常去关注看看哈\n买豆豆，进微店",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          --- 俺们的铁杆客人龚玉同学的心血\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          --- 从小镇的点评，到梅龙镇与小镇店的外卖平台\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          --- 龚老师是苦口婆心多次提醒，要记得通知大家\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          --- 最后，实在实在憋不住了，连文案也一并提供了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          大写的\n         </span>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">\n           棒\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">\n           棒哒\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          立秋来了，还有台风暴雨大太阳\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          还不马上来一杯有容乃大的外卖？\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          什么？你不知道小短手的外卖已经上线了？\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          （加两个截屏）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9JBDS1Ixcug7oFnsabtsd2875ckvlP7QWWoko5gnsKw24qvNMDkejcicvqUhicMjicMNpy3NEm3FASA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9JBDS1Ixcug7oFnsabtsd2eA6BHPyEVhA3j5Rv55cLibDK9XcPiaBhR2s4qAQblDsUZReuuDtY89Pw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          还不赶快点一杯试试看\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          *友情提醒，虽然“小短手”的同学们已经用处女座plus模式测试了各种外卖方案，但外卖实际效果与到店饮用有一定差异，敬请谅解。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           推荐：\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           冰美式， 冰拿铁，茶拿铁，巧克力\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          突然想到一个推广：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          每月在外卖平台，累计点够10杯的客人，可以喜提以下福利（任选1）\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            店内任意咖啡饮品一杯\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            混合挂耳包一盒（邮费到付）\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          外卖平台的优惠券会陆续更新起来\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          记得时常去关注看看哈\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          买豆豆，进微店\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n8Y9vYibh11kLP9LaJ3XvF2pkFCWzVzI6xDXrl8yfFrSGkGibj50Kf8OdW1phgBq9smic9TQxpbFicicsQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n</div>",
